Modifications (this repository, 2026-07-22):
- Quantized to 6-bit (group_size 64, affine, 6.550 bpw) with the official
  mlx_audio.convert from mlx-audio 0.4.5.
- Audio codec weights extracted from the LM checkpoint into codec.safetensors
  (prefix tied.embedding.modality_embeddings.0.model.*).
- model.safetensors.index.json removed (required for mlx-audio codec discovery).
- config.json model_type set to "higgs_audio_v3" (was "higgs_multimodal_qwen3");
  works around model-detection ambiguity in mlx-audio 0.4.5
  (https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-audio/issues/854).
